profile: gguf-mirust.receiver-brief.v1
updated_utc: 2026-06-25T00:00:00Z
brief: GGUF.MiRust.com now contains TinyRustLM, a zero-dependency Rust/WASM browser-local SLM runtime and UI. Treat trained-model quality, GGUF compatibility, Mini Browser work, and broader orchestration as pending until source and tests prove them.
must_read:
  - AGENTS.md
  - workspace.uai
  - .uai/workspace-guidance.uai
  - .uai/file-handoff.uai
  - .uai/long-term-memory.uai
  - .uai/test-plan.uai
